    "details": "Drupal core reports:\n\n> A remote code execution vulnerability exists within the Field UI\n> module in Drupal core.\n>\n> The vulnerability is not directly exploitable with core alone, but\n> multiple serious exploit paths exist with contributed modules. At\n> least one known exploit path does not require authentication. Custom\n> code may also expose the vulnerable functionality.\n>\n> The vulnerability can be mitigated by uninstalling the core Field UI\n> module (field_ui), which will provide protection while sites are\n> updated.\n",
